Subject: [PATCH] Fix compatibility with cucumber-messages 25.

This is roughly equivalent to:

https://github.com/cucumber/gherkin/pull/259/commits/9741cbf0b91562c4a0fbaa5a12eacd8d843dbd2b
---
 ruby/lib/gherkin/parser.rb | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ruby/lib/gherkin/parser.rb b/ruby/lib/gherkin/parser.rb
index a6bf4068..89f35e74 100644
--- a/ruby/lib/gherkin/parser.rb
+++ b/ruby/lib/gherkin/parser.rb
@@ -4,6 +4,10 @@ require_relative 'token_matcher'
